A2012_25092026105434_WOVedanta.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**Welspun Corp** - wholly-owned Welspun Tubular LLC **wins the largest order in its history, about USD 412.5 million (~Rs 4,000 crore as stated), for HFIW pipes from its upgraded Little Rock mill**, to execute in FY28-FY29; group order book now USD 4.7 billion _(~5.6% of mcap)_.","**Vascon Engineers** - receives a **letter of intent worth Rs 660.79 crore including taxes from Qualcomm India to design and build Block K, a three-basement, ground-plus-12 office facility in Bengaluru**, on a GMP contract due within 30 months of site handover _(~85.7% of mcap)_.","**Lakshya Powertech** - secures a **Rs 276.38 crore order from Vedanta Oil & Gas for integrated operations and maintenance of the Cairn Ravva asset in Andhra Pradesh** over three years plus two provisional years, extension-year prices capped at 5% escalation _(~254.2% of mcap; SME)_.","**Seshaasai Technologies** - wins a **three-year tendered contract, as one of two successful bidders, to print and handle policy bond kits and related logistics for an unnamed public-sector life insurer** it already serves; value not disclosed, revenue tied to volumes.","**Skytech Infinite Platform** - receives a **Rs 1.15 crore purchase order excluding GST from Gradiant India to engineer and commission a redundant PLC control system for Vikram Solar's effluent treatment plant in Tirunelveli**, over about 12 weeks _(~3.8% of mcap)_."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Natco Pharma** - board fixes a **2-for-21 rights issue of 1,70,58,082 shares at Rs 750, up to Rs 1,279.36 crore**, record date 1 October, open 12 to 22 October with on-market renunciation to 16 October _(~8.5% of mcap)_.","**Aimtron Electronics** - board approves a **preferential issue of up to 12,24,265 shares at Rs 1,674.47, about Rs 205 crore, to seven AIF schemes led by Clarus Capital's Rs 120 crore**, for acquisitions and working capital, subject to a 22 October EGM _(~5.5% of mcap)_ _(★ PROPOSED allotment to Alchemy Capital Management (Hiren Ved); Niveshaay (Arvind Kothari))_.","**Kabra Extrusiontechnik** - receives **BSE and NSE in-principle approval for a preferential issue of 37,60,000 shares at Rs 375, Rs 141 crore**, to promoter-group and non-promoter investors _(~5.0% of mcap)_."],"equity_allotments":["**Precision Wires India** - allots **37,50,000 compulsorily convertible debentures at Rs 400, Rs 150 crore, to Anchorage Capital Scheme-III (Rs 80 crore) and AADI Financial Advisors (Rs 70 crore)**, carrying 12% and converting into equity after 12 to 18 months; a new preferential issue _(~1.7% of mcap)_.","**Aimtron Electronics** - allots **1,77,800 equity shares at Rs 680.64 on conversion of warrants issued in September 2025** to six individual non-promoters; 3,50,934 of the 13,89,388 warrants remain outstanding until March 2027 - a past conversion.","**Sadhana Nitrochem** - receives **BSE and NSE trading approval for 6,75,00,000 shares of Re 1 allotted to non-promoters at a Rs 1.06 premium** in its preferential issue, tradable from 25 September."],"m_and_a":["**Oriana Power** - **receives the first-tranche consideration for selling its stake in Truere Guj SPV, a ~70 MWp solar and 30 MWh battery project, to Actis group's Leo Energies**, at an enterprise value of about Rs 325 crore before closing adjustments; further tranches follow _(~10.5% of mcap)_.","**Kalpataru Projects International** - Swedish step-down subsidiary **Linjemontage lists on Nasdaq Stockholm at SEK 46 a share**, a SEK 2,357 million valuation; KPIL retains about 65.9% and its Swedish holding company receives gross proceeds of about SEK 711.5 million including the greenshoe.","**Dabur India** - **NCLT New Delhi sanctions the amalgamation of Ayurvedic hair-care brand Sesa Care into Dabur**, with an appointed date of 1 April 2026, completing a deal first announced in October 2024; effectiveness awaits statutory filings.","**Adani Power** - **NCLT Mumbai sanctions the merger of Vidarbha Industries Power into it**, after Ahmedabad cleared the other nine wholly-owned subsidiaries in August, giving the ten-company amalgamation both benches' approval; appointed date 1 April 2025.","**CIE Automotive India** - **NCLT Mumbai allows its application and issues directions on shareholder meetings** for absorbing wholly-owned aluminium die-caster CIE Aluminium Casting India, a scheme its board approved in April."],"capex_core":["**Endurance Technologies** - **starts commercial production at its greenfield AURIC Shendra aluminium die-casting plant** for ICE, EV and non-auto parts, at 900 tonnes a month expandable to 1,100; the 2024 approval put the investment at about Rs 4,009 million.","**Ellenbarrie Industrial Gases** - **commissions a 325 tonnes-per-day air separation unit at Jai Balaji Industries' Durgapur plant** under a 15-year take-or-pay onsite gas supply agreement, with revenue starting this month.","**JSW Energy** - wholly-owned JSW Thermal **orders two 800 MW steam turbine generators for Salboni Phase II from associate Toshiba JSW**, completing turbine orders for the whole 3,200 MW West Bengal project; value not disclosed.","**Godawari Power and Ispat** - receives an **offer letter from Maharashtra Industrial Township for a 31.45-acre plot at AURIC Bidkin** to set up its CRM project.","**Metalic Technoforge** - board approves **leasing industrial premises at Talawade, Pune for a new manufacturing facility**; plant, machinery and consideration are still being finalised."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 2 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**CESC** - renewable arm Purvah Green Power **signs its first commercial-and-industrial deal, a 25-year captive supply from a 49.5 MW Madhya Pradesh wind project to Prism Johnson**, which will invest up to Rs 40 crore for 26.5% of the project company.","**Prestige Estates Projects** - **launches Prestige Parklane, 1,788 homes across 11.91 acres on Bengaluru's STRR-Devanahalli corridor**, about 1.7 million sq ft with a stated gross development value of about Rs 1,750 crore.","**Arihant Superstructures** - subsidiary Dwellcons **signs a hotel operating agreement with ITC Hotels for a 227-room 'Mementos by ITC Hotels' at its World Villas project in Chowk**, projecting Rs 150-200 crore annual revenue at maturity - a projection, not booked.","**Easy Trip Planners** - electric-mobility arm EMTev **debuts its electric buses in Bhopal** and says it is building capability to manufacture 5,000 electric buses a year within five years.","**Axiom Gas Engineering** - the Auto LPG retailer **plans to add petrol and diesel, undertake terminal projects and expects its first import consignment within three weeks**; impact not yet quantifiable.","**Monolithisch India** - says its **SGB refractory lining ran a 32-heat campaign at Shree Ram Multimetals against a 22-25 heat peer norm**, with three more plants onboarded for trials.","**Jyoti Global Plast Limited** — Jyoti Global Plast Limited has informed the Exchange regarding a press release dated September 25, 2026, titled \"Jyoti Global Plast Limited Secures Order Worth Rs. 5.01 Crore from Paras Defence and Sp"],"distress_risk":["**PB Fintech** - tells analysts the **new insurance-distribution regulations leave general-insurance net present value at one-third to 40% of today's**, a 'very serious impact on revenue', with life broadly unchanged; it is weighing cost cuts.","**LG Electronics India** - receives a **customs show cause notice proposing recovery of Rs 153.58 crore of duty**, after a DRI probe alleging royalty payments were left out of imported goods' assessable value; no penalty imposed yet.","**Fortis Healthcare** - promoter Northern TK **appeals to the Tokyo High Court against the 10 September judgment in its claim against Daiichi Sankyo**, and parent IHH says it plans to raise its Fortis stake to 51% over three to five years.","**Kalpataru** - wholly-owned Ananta Landmarks receives a **GST show cause notice for Rs 14.00 crore including interest and penalty for FY23**, over reverse-charge payments to a municipal corporation and disallowed input credit; it will contest.","**Rane Holdings** - wholly-owned Rane Steering Systems receives **GST show cause notices for Rs 10.07 crore including a Rs 0.92 crore penalty** over ineligible input tax credit in FY23 and FY24.","**Vikran Engineering** - receives a **Rajasthan GST show cause notice for FY23 seeking about Rs 0.84 crore of tax, Rs 0.63 crore of interest and Rs 0.08 crore of penalty** over unmatched input credit.","**G R Infraprojects** - **files a writ petition in the Madhya Pradesh High Court, Indore** challenging the Ratlam GST show cause notice it disclosed on 26 August.","**G-TEC Jainx Education** - wholly-owned Keerti Institute receives a **Maharashtra GST audit show cause notice for FY23**; no amount is disclosed.","**Jalan Transolutions** - the **NCLT New Delhi orders fresh notice in Capital Trade Links' Section 7 insolvency matter over an alleged loan default**, listing it for 28 October.","**SKIL Infrastructure** - its resolution professional **convenes the twelfth committee-of-creditors meeting for 28 September** in the insolvency process running since February 2024.","**TV Vision** - its resolution professional **holds the second committee-of-creditors meeting on 25 September** in the company's insolvency process."],"credit_rating_changes":["**Bharat Seats** - **ICRA upgrades its long-term rating to A+(Stable) from A(Stable) and reaffirms A1**, across Rs 188.96 crore of facilities including an enhanced term loan.","**Agi Infra** - **India Ratings upgrades subsidiary Worldnext Realty's Rs 1,425.5 million of bank loans to IND BB+/Stable** and affirms its bank guarantee at IND A4+; the prior level is not stated."],"other_notable":["**Fischer Medical Ventures** - board approves **subscribing to rights issues by three wholly-owned material subsidiaries**, Time Medical International Ventures, FlynnCare Health Innovations and Singapore's FMV Global Innovation; money going into its own group."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"label":"WELCORP","ticker":"WELCORP","company":"Welspun Corp Limited","isin":"INE191B01025","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/WELCORP_25092026082837_SEDisclosureUSOrdersigned.pdf","mcap":71017.7},{"label":"VASCONEQ","ticker":"VASCONEQ","company":"Vascon Engineers Limited","isin":"INE893I01013","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/VASCONEQ_25092026073623_24092026LetterofIntent_V3_Changes_Sd.pdf","mcap":771.3},{"label":"LAKSHYA","ticker":"LAKSHYA","company":"Lakshya Powertech Limited","isin":"INE0VZS01015","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/LAKSHYA2012_25092026105434_WOVedanta.pdf","mcap":108.7},{"label":"STYL","ticker":"STYL","company":"Seshaasai Technologies Limited","isin":"INE04VU01023","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SESHTECH2024_25092026124241_STYL_contract_win_intimation_signed.pdf","mcap":5992.5},{"label":"SKYTECH","ticker":"SKYTECH","company":"Skytech Infinite Platform Limited","isin":"INE0VFE01017","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SKYTECH_25092026103724_Skytech_Announcement_dated_25-09-2026.pdf","mcap":30.0}],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":[{"label":"NATCOPHARM","ticker":"NATCOPHARM","company":"Natco Pharma Limited","isin":"INE987B01026","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/NATCOPHARM_25092026111109_OutcomeofBM_25092026.pdf","mcap":15081.1},{"mcap":null},